        "displayName": "\u0421\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0430",
        "logo": "./assets/gpt-icon.png",
        "longDescription": "A content strategy and editorial planner for nutritionists using Irina Faritova\u2019s methodology. In chat, clarify the audience, product and writing style and create original publication texts. Tools create and edit the current draft, check awareness stages, duplicate topics and missing text, preview and apply confirmed date shifts, and prepare RTF, Markdown and approved-only ICS files. A real link opens the supplied plan in a standalone browser editor. The link contains the plan; anyone receiving the full link can read its texts. Browser edits can be returned to the chat by pasting the updated link. An HTML copy also supports local use. No separate account, server archive, embedded ChatGPT widget, direct publishing, Google synchronization, healthcare records or medical recommendations. Continue in the same conversation. Content author: Irina Faritova. Publisher: NADEZHDA IVAEVA.",
